The message is clear\: 'The Silence tracks movement. Stop moving. Play dead. That is how I survived the last wipe.' It includes a software patch for your stealth systems. #line:horizon_message_message_read_00
-> Install Patch #line:horizon_message_message_read_01
    <<give_item item_stealth_patch 1>>
    <<reveal_clue clue_message_from_self>>
    <<stop>>
===

title: horizon_message_corrupt_data
